+Without that gauge the last coefficient is \(42/(c_fc_g)\). This is the equation in `cases/directionb_strike.py` and `SHEET6-DIRECTIONB.md` §0. Its derivative at \(s\), for a six-tuple \(h\) of tail-function variations, is
