+1. Reconstruct the named source point using the existing verified `fiber_coordinates_22`, band-pivot, auxiliary, and `deep_tails` data. Make a deterministic zero completion: set `uf30`, the four level-51 tails, the four level-53 tails, and every later unspecified coefficient to zero, and hash that choice. This is one polynomial representative, not a coordinate-invariant “canonical” completion. Do not random-fill future derivatives.
