+
+### 1.2 The deterministic square block
+
+The square-block construction requires the following **all-depth cyclic-character lemma**, not merely a D23 pattern match:
+
+\[
+ \mathcal E=\sum_{a=0}^{28}E_a(t)\eta^a,\qquad
